    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Human.</strong> Normalized BBTTCC ancestry root.</p><p>Select one heritage separately when building the character: <strong>Cro-Magnon, Denisovan, Florensis, Neanderthal</strong>.</p><p>This root grants the shared Human core trait package and preserves live UUID compatibility for existing feature items.</p><p><em>“Humanity is not special. It’s just stubborn enough to keep moving when reality begs it to stop.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Adaptive.</strong> Once per a Soma Break, when you fail a defense check, you can choose to succeed instead.</p>\n<p><strong>Tenacious.</strong> While you have 1 Integrity, you have reroll the lowest die on one checks [TODO(adv-call)] of your choice each round (declare before rolling).</p>\n<p><strong>Lineage Memory.</strong> Choose one human lineage (Cro-Magnon, Denisovan, Florensis, Neanderthal). Your lineage grants Tier powers as you level.</p>",
